            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩngĩ yĩla mũndũ mũka ũkevĩtĩa Yeova wĩvĩto, na kwĩyova na wovo, e nyũmbanĩ ya ĩthe wake, wĩĩtunĩ wake, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ĩthe wake akĩw’a wĩvĩto wake, na kwĩyova kwake kũla wĩyovete ngoo yake nakw’o, na ĩthe wake akamũvindĩsya; nĩvo ĩndĩ mawĩvĩto make onthe makekala, na kĩla wovo ũla wĩyovethetye ngoo yake naw’o ũkekala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa ĩthe wake akamũvata mũthenya o ũla wĩĩw’a, mawĩvĩto make o na ũmwe, kana mawovo make o na ũmwe, ala wĩyovethetye ngoo yake namo, matikekala: na Yeova akamũekea, nũndũ ĩthe wake nĩwamũvatie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa nake nĩ mũtwae, yĩla wĩ na mawĩvĩto make, kana ndeto sya ilomo syake ila ũneenete ateũsũanĩa, ila wĩyovethetye ngoo yake nasyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mũũme akawĩw’a, na kũmũvindĩsya mũthenya ũla wĩĩw’a; nĩvo ĩndĩ mawĩvĩto make makekala, na mawovo make ala wĩyovethetye ngoo yake namo makekala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa mũũme akamũvata mũthenya o ũla wĩĩw’a, nĩvo ĩndĩ ũkatw’ĩkĩthya wĩvĩto wake ũla wĩ naw’o wĩthĩwe wa mana, na ndeto syake ila ũneenete na ilomo syake ateũsũanĩa, ila wĩyovethetye ngoo yake nasyo: na Yeova akamũekea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ wĩvĩto wa mũndũ mũka ndiwa, kana wa ũla ũtaanĩsye na mũũme, o kĩla ũndũ ũla weyovethisye ngoo yake naw’o, ũkekala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa nĩmevĩtĩie e kwa mũũme, kana nĩweyovethisye ngoo yake na wovo wa wĩvĩto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mũũme awĩw’a, na amũvindĩsya, na ndaamũvata; nĩvo ĩndĩ mawĩvĩto make onthe makekala, na kĩla wovo ũla wĩyovethetye ngoo yake naw’o ũkekala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa mũũme wake nĩwamatw’ĩkĩthisye ma mana vyũ mũthenya o ũsu ũla wamewie, nĩvo ĩndĩ ũndũ o na wĩva w’onthe ũla wumĩte ilomonĩ syake ũndũ wa mawĩvĩto make, kana ũndũ wa wĩyovethyo wa ngoo yake, ũteĩkala; mũũme wake nũmatw’ĩkĩthĩtye ma mana; na Yeova akamũekea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kĩla wĩvĩto, na kĩla wĩavo wa kwĩyovethya wa kũthĩn’ya ngoo, mũũme wake nũtonya kũwũlũmya, kana mũũme wake nũtonya kũwũtw’ĩkĩthya wa mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa mũũme wake akamũvindĩsya ki mĩthenya yonthe, nĩvo ĩndĩ ũnũũlũlũmĩlya mawĩvĩto make onthe, kana mawĩyovethyo make onthe ala wĩ namo: nũmalũlũmĩlye nũndũ nĩwamũvindĩsye mũthenya ũla wamewie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa akamatw’ĩkĩthya ma mana vyũ ĩtina wa kũmew’a, nĩvo ĩndĩ wĩkua ũthũku wa mũka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asu nĩmo myamũlo, ala Yeova wamwĩaĩe Mose, katĩ wa mũndũ na mũka, na katĩ wa ĩthe na mwĩĩtu wake, e wĩĩtunĩ wake, kwa ĩthe wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
